        <param name="hardwareBufferFormat">The HardwareBuffer format of the image that this writer will produce. Value is one of the following: HardwareBuffer.RGBA_8888 HardwareBuffer.RGBA_FP16 HardwareBuffer.RGBA_1010102 HardwareBuffer.RGBX_8888 HardwareBuffer.RGB_888 HardwareBuffer.RGB_565 HardwareBuffer.BLOB HardwareBuffer.YCBCR_420_888 HardwareBuffer.D_16 HardwareBuffer.D_24 HardwareBuffer.DS_24UI8 HardwareBuffer.D_FP32 HardwareBuffer.DS_FP32UI8 HardwareBuffer.S_UI8 HardwareBuffer.YCBCR_P010 HardwareBuffer.YCBCR_P210 HardwareBuffer.R_8 HardwareBuffer.R_16 HardwareBuffer.RG_1616 HardwareBuffer.RGBA_10101010 HardwareBuffer.R_12 HardwareBuffer.R_14 HardwareBuffer.RG_1212 HardwareBuffer.RG_1414 HardwareBuffer.RGBA_12121212 HardwareBuffer.RGBA_14141414 HardwareBuffer.BGRA_1010102 HardwareBuffer.BGRX_1010102</param>
